# Research Archive Directory
# ⚠️ MARKED AS ARCHIVED - NOT FOR PRODUCTION
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# The entire research/ directory is now ARCHIVED
# It contains historical research materials and should NOT be:
# - Loaded by the main build system (surgio.conf.js)
# - Included in production builds
# - Modified without proper version control review

research/
!research/ARCHIVE-INDEX.md  # Keep the index file as reference
!research/*.md              # Keep top-level documentation

